# ==============================================================================
# BHYH Git Attributes & Cross-Platform Normalization Specification
# Aligned with Godot Engine Official Best Practices
# ==============================================================================

# 1. 默认文本规则：强制所有文本文件检出与提交统一使用 LF 行尾
* text=auto eol=lf

# 2. 核心源码与引擎文本资产（强制 LF）
*.gd text eol=lf
*.tscn text eol=lf
*.tres text eol=lf
*.gdshader text eol=lf
*.cfg text eol=lf
*.import text eol=lf
*.gdextension text eol=lf
*.uid text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf

# 3. 文档、脚本与工具链（强制 LF）
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
.editorconfig text eol=lf
.gdlintrc text eol=lf

# 4. 二进制资源文件（严禁任何文本/换行符转换）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.mp3 binary
*.MP3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.ttf binary
*.ttc binary
*.otf binary
*.ogv binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.res binary
*.scn binary
*.ico binary
*.pck binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.bin binary
